                        "review": "whoa man where to fuggin start...mind blowing game man,and wtf was ep 5 ....it was inception type shit \nI am literally blown away by the story and variety of choices you get which effects the past,present and the future...and every single choices matter in this game so better to think 10 times atleast before giving any choices....this is THE BEST choice based game i played in my 2 years og gaming and i was mind blown...i am looking forward to play all of the life is strange games now \nAnd there are so many ester eggs and secrets which you cant even find in your 2nd or 3rd playtrhough....just shows the love developers put onto this game\nI would rate this game a 11/10,...its a MASTERPIECE (i cant go any lower sry)",
